      "text_parts": [
        "ADR-047 conflict: publication races persistence.\nThe assignment publishes before durable append.\nADR-047 requires persist, then publish.\nA crash between those steps loses the item.\nLena: amend the story acceptance order.\nJun: keep the owner lock through publication.\nDo not acknowledge on arrival or passive View.\nRetain the peer-tainted context boundary.\nReview is local; only an operator may Send.\nPreserve ordered recipients and exact UTF-8 bytes.\nR\u00e9sum\u00e9: preserve na\u00efve input and e\u0301.\nDecision: persist the row before showing its card."
